#: docs/journeys.md:93
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Each step names the requirements of <a0>smart-trust-tools</a0> it exercises, and the FHIR examples of this guide it produces. The stories are in <a1>{code0}</a1>. Each moment ends with its pain point, what enables it, and the policy point it makes, as the VaxLink walkthrough presents them."
msgstr "每个步骤都指明它所使用的 <a0>smart-trust-tools</a0> 需求，以及它所产生的本指南 FHIR 示例。故事见 <a1>{code0}</a1>。每个时刻都以其痛点、促成因素以及它所表达的政策要点结尾，与 VaxLink 演练中的呈现方式一致。"

#: docs/journeys.md:146
msgid "Enabler (J2a): The phone reads the card offline, and keeps “what the family told us” clearly separate from “what we have verified”."
msgstr "促成因素（J2a）：手机离线读取卡片，并将“家庭告诉我们的信息”与“我们已验证的信息”清晰地区分开来。"

#: docs/journeys.md:147
msgid "Enabler (J2b): An offline form links the baby to his household immediately; it syncs once the phone finds a signal."
msgstr "促成因素（J2b）：离线表单立即将婴儿与其家庭关联起来；手机一旦找到信号就会同步。"

#: docs/journeys.md:177
msgid "Enabler (J3a): Taifafeki’s signing key is on the shared WHO trust list, so any clinic can check it locally."
msgstr "促成因素（J3a）：泰法费基的签名密钥在共享的 WHO 信任列表上，因此任何诊所都可以在本地进行核验。"

#: docs/journeys.md:178
msgid "Enabler (J3b): Taifafeki’s original code is kept and the Onesan code is added alongside; the schedule engine calculates what’s due."
msgstr "促成因素（J3b）：保留泰法费基的原始编码，并在其旁边添加奥内萨的编码；接种计划引擎计算应接种的剂次。"

#: docs/journeys.md:202
msgid "Enabler (J4.0a): A household wallet on one phone, with a separate health summary for each person."
msgstr "促成因素（J4.0a）：一部手机上的家庭钱包，为每个人保存单独的健康摘要。"

#: docs/journeys.md:203
msgid "Enabler (J4.0b): A Verifiable Health Link: the QR holds only a locked pointer; the data stays home until the passcode is given."
msgstr "促成因素（J4.0b）：可验证健康链接（Verifiable Health Link）：QR 码只包含一个加锁的指针；在提供通行码之前，数据一直留在本国。"

#: docs/journeys.md:124
msgid "Enabler: A digitally signed QR card travels with the family — no ID number or database lookup needed."
msgstr "促成因素：一张数字签名的 QR 卡随家庭一起流动——无需身份证号码或数据库查询。"

#: docs/journeys.md:229
msgid "Enabler: The record is fetched live from Onesa, viewed without being copied, and an access log is sent home."
msgstr "促成因素：记录从奥内萨实时获取，仅查看而不复制，并且访问日志会发回本国。"

