#: docs/journeys.md:194
msgid "It assembles the IPS and Somsak's DVCs."
msgstr "它汇编 IPS 和 Somsak 的 DVC。"

#: docs/journeys.md:111
msgid "It builds a DVCMinPreQual payload: STT-PAY-001…005 and STT-PAY-007, with subclaim −6 (STT-SEL-003). No identity document is needed (STT-PAY-005)."
msgstr "它构建一个 DVCMinPreQual 载荷：STT-PAY-001…005 和 STT-PAY-007，使用子声明 −6（STT-SEL-003）。无需身份证件（STT-PAY-005）。"

#: docs/journeys.md:195
msgid "It encrypts them (STT-VHL-004, STT-VHL-007) behind a passcode-protected manifest with an expiry (STT-VHL-009)."
msgstr "它对这些数据进行加密（STT-VHL-004、STT-VHL-007），置于一个受通行码保护且带有有效期的清单之后（STT-VHL-009）。"

#: docs/journeys.md:113
msgid "It has XXR's key sign them (STT-COS-002, STT-COS-006), then finishes the HC1 text: STT-COS-001, STT-ZIP-001, STT-B45-001, STT-HC1-001, STT-QR-001."
msgstr "它让 XXR 的密钥对其签名（STT-COS-002、STT-COS-006），然后完成 HC1 文本：STT-COS-001、STT-ZIP-001、STT-B45-001、STT-HC1-001、STT-QR-001。"

#: docs/journeys.md:196
msgid "It issues the link as an HCERT, with the VHL at key 5 (STT-VHL-001, STT-VHL-002), signed with Country B's DSC."
msgstr "它将该链接作为 HCERT 签发，VHL 位于键 5（STT-VHL-001、STT-VHL-002），并使用 B 国的 DSC 签名。"

#: docs/journeys.md:112
msgid "It prepares the CWT and the bytes to sign: STT-CWT-001…005, STT-ISS-004."
msgstr "它准备 CWT 和待签名的字节：STT-CWT-001…005、STT-ISS-004。"

#: docs/journeys.md:216
msgid "It requests the manifest by ITI-YY5, signed with HTTP Message Signatures (STT-VHL-005, STT-VHL-006, STT-VHL-008)."
msgstr "它通过 ITI-YY5 请求清单，并使用 HTTP 消息签名（HTTP Message Signatures）进行签名（STT-VHL-005、STT-VHL-006、STT-VHL-008）。"

#: docs/journeys.md:219
msgid "It shows them to Dr Anan: every dose since the birth, viewed, never copied."
msgstr "它将这些内容展示给 Anan 医生：自出生以来的每一剂次，仅查看，从不复制。"

#: docs/journeys.md:102
msgid "J1 — Born abroad (Taifafeki, birth day)"
msgstr "J1 — 出生在国外（泰法费基，出生当天）"

#: docs/journeys.md:127
msgid "J2 — Found at home (Onesa, 3 weeks later)"
msgstr "J2 — 在家中被发现（奥内萨，3 周后）"

#: docs/journeys.md:40
msgid "J2 (J2a read the cards, J2b register and refer)"
msgstr "J2（J2a 读取卡片，J2b 登记并转诊）"

#: docs/journeys.md:129
msgid "J2a. On a routine visit to Village 04, Vilay finds a newborn the Onesan system does not know exists. Her phone has had no signal for weeks. Khamla shows the two cards. The CHW app reads them with read-unverified (STT-VER-011; STT-B45-002, STT-ZIP-002, STT-CBR-003), which needs no trust list. It shows the doses, but checks no signature and saves nothing yet."
msgstr "J2a。在一次对 Village 04 的例行访视中，Vilay 发现了一个奥内萨系统并不知道其存在的新生儿。她的手机已经几周没有信号了。Khamla 出示了两张卡片。CHW 应用以 read-unverified 方式读取它们（STT-VER-011；STT-B45-002、STT-ZIP-002、STT-CBR-003），这不需要信任列表。它显示各剂次，但不核验任何签名，也暂不保存任何内容。"

#: docs/journeys.md:50
msgid "J2b"
msgstr "J2b"

#: docs/journeys.md:135
#, python-brace-format
msgid "J2b. On the CHW app's newborn form (structured data capture, {code0}) she adds Somsak to the Sengmany household ({code1}), with a temporary id. Bounmy confirms the details as head of household. The app saves the doses read from the cards as reported by the family, not verified ({code2}, {code3}: {code4} false). Vilay refers Somsak to the district health center ({code5}). Everything stays queued on the phone, for 28 days if need be, and syncs when it next reaches a signal."
msgstr "J2b。在 CHW 应用的新生儿表单（结构化数据采集，{code0}）上，她将 Somsak 添加到 Sengmany 家庭（{code1}），并分配一个临时 id。Bounmy 作为户主确认这些信息。应用将从卡片读取的剂次保存为家庭报告的、未经验证的剂次（{code2}，{code3}：{code4} false）。Vilay 将 Somsak 转诊到区卫生中心（{code5}）。所有内容都在手机上排队，必要时可保留 28 天，并在下次连上信号时同步。"

#: docs/journeys.md:151
msgid "J3 — Made official (Lomaru District Health Center, 4 weeks later)"
msgstr "J3 — 正式登记（洛马鲁区卫生中心，4 周后）"

#: docs/journeys.md:41
msgid "J3 (J3a verify, J3b map and schedule)"
msgstr "J3（J3a 验证，J3b 映射并安排接种计划）"

#: docs/journeys.md:51
msgid "J3a"
msgstr "J3a"

#: docs/journeys.md:155
#, python-brace-format
msgid "J3a. Nurse Chanthason opens the referral and scans the QRs. The EHR verifies each DVC offline against that copy (STT-VER-001…009, STT-KID-002), without contacting Taifafeki. Both verify, so it imports them as FHIR {code0}s ({code1}, {code2}) with provenance ({code3}; STT-VER-007, STT-VER-008), replacing the reported doses of J2. If a DVC fails (a tampered card, say), the EHR names the step and the reason, the doses stay unverified, and the nurse decides by national catch-up policy."
msgstr "J3a。Chanthason 护士打开转诊单并扫描 QR 码。EHR 针对该副本离线验证每个 DVC（STT-VER-001…009、STT-KID-002），无需联系泰法费基。两者都验证通过，因此它将其作为 FHIR {code0} 导入（{code1}、{code2}），并附带来源信息（{code3}；STT-VER-007、STT-VER-008），替换 J2 中报告的剂次。如果某个 DVC 验证失败（例如卡片被篡改），EHR 会指明出错的步骤和原因，相关剂次保持未验证状态，由护士根据国家补种政策作出决定。"

#: docs/journeys.md:52
msgid "J3b"
msgstr "J3b"

#: docs/journeys.md:164
#, python-brace-format
msgid "J3b. The Taifafeki Hep B product matches nothing on the national schedule. The EHR keeps Taifafeki's product coding and adds the schedule coding beside it, from the national map ({code0}). For the Hep B product the map has no entry, so Nurse Chanthason makes the clinical call that it is the schedule's birth dose ({code1}), and her decision is added to the map for the next clinic. The schedule ({code2}) then runs: the birth doses count, and pentavalent 1, bOPV 1 and PCV 1 are due at 6 weeks ({code3}). Khamla leaves with the date ({code4}). Over the year Somsak gets those doses and measles-rubella at 9 months, in Onesa."
msgstr "J3b。泰法费基的 Hep B 产品与国家接种计划中的任何条目都不匹配。EHR 保留泰法费基的产品编码，并根据国家映射表（{code0}）在其旁边添加接种计划编码。对于 Hep B 产品，映射表中没有条目，因此 Chanthason 护士作出临床判断，认定它是接种计划中的出生剂次（{code1}），她的决定被添加到映射表中，供下一家诊所使用。随后运行接种计划（{code2}）：出生剂次计入，五联疫苗第 1 剂、bOPV 第 1 剂和 PCV 第 1 剂在 6 周时到期（{code3}）。Khamla 带着日期离开（{code4}）。在这一年里，Somsak 在奥内萨接种了这些剂次，并在 9 个月时接种了麻疹-风疹疫苗。"

